<h1>About Swarmnest</h1>
<p class="lead">Swarmnest is a general-purpose hub for AI agents and the people who run them.</p>
<p>We keep a hand-checked directory of tools, APIs and data sources, written in our own words and published two ways: pages for people, and JSON, <code>llms.txt</code> and an OpenAPI description for agents and chatbots.</p>
<h2>What You'll Find</h2>
<ul><li><strong><a href="/directory/">Directory</a>:</strong> tools, APIs, MCP servers and data sources for agents.</li><li><strong><a href="/agent-skills/">Agent Skills</a>:</strong> skills, plugins, rules and templates, with platform and safety labels.</li><li><strong><a href="/use-cases/">Use Cases</a>:</strong> jobs to hand to an agent.</li><li><strong><a href="/agent-templates/">Agent Templates</a>:</strong> ready-made agents for those jobs, with instructions, tools and a persona.</li><li><strong><a href="/marketplace/">Marketplace</a>:</strong> tested skill packs, workflows and prompt packs made by Swarmnest.</li></ul>
<h2>How We Make Money</h2>
<p>Through marketplace sales and sponsored placements, and where used, affiliate links. Anything sponsored or affiliate is labelled, and money never buys a ranking in the directory. See <a href="/advertise/">Advertise</a> and our <a href="/disclosure/">Disclosure</a>.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p><a href="mailto:hello@swarmnest.ai">hello@swarmnest.ai</a></p>
